{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'cat data/accounting-master/deliverables/P06/progress.md'","aggregated_output":"# P06 repair progress\n\nRecovery verified: all eight phase files exist; the prior process timed out despite a worker-authored passing report. The approved plan and execution inventories are present. No independent result acceptance exists.\n\nSkeptical audit found material omissions in the recovered candidate: component mappings lacked membership semantics; harmonisation only recorded metadata; supersession selection missed transitive unavailable intermediates; uncertainty categories mostly checked field presence; source evidence did not drive integrated derivation; grouping reuse was not bound to constituent data. Existing passing probes are insufficient for the approved criteria.\n\nRepair scope: only the existing P06 runtime, profile, fixture, tests, checker and declared outputs. Preserve all protected inputs and prior snapshots. Exact Fraction arithmetic, finite populations, Gregorian intervals and fixed unhedged bullet debt remain bounded assumptions. No scientific experiment or default promotion is being run.\n\nTargeted repair completed: original evidence mode now retains eligible lineage roots\nwhen a later revision is also eligible; latest_available remains the mode that\nremoves superseded roots. Malformed finite joint laws, historical constraints and\nelection treatment lists now fail with stable P06Error codes instead of incidental\nattribute/type errors. Added focused regressions for each case.\n\nChanged files: scripts/context_chronology_v1.py and tests/test_accounting_p06.py.\nNext checks: run the P06/P03/P04 unittest discovery with\nCUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1; regenerate conformance.json/result.md using the approved\nplan and execution-1/pre-edit-files.json; verify the injected-failure exit,\nobligation coverage, source hashes and protected-file comparison. Remaining work\nis generated evidence and independent result review; accounting, forecast and\nhuman acceptance remain outside this slice.\n\nChecks completed: P06 27/27, P03 11/11 and P04 21/21 unittest methods pass;\npy_compile passes; the checker reports all nine obligations observed once,\nzero failures/errors/skips, stable source hashes and protected=true. An independent\n`--inject-failure` run returned exit 1 and wrote passed=false, followed by fresh\npassing checker runs that regenerated the authoritative conformance.json and\nresult.md after the final checker prose update. Remaining deliverable is\nindependent result review.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
